# =============================================================================
# Trivy Security Ignore Policy for Hospital Queue Management System
# Policy: All exceptions must be narrowly scoped with justified rationale.
# =============================================================================

# AVD-AWS-0104: Unrestricted outbound egress on ports 80, 443, and 53.
# Justification: The EC2 instance requires outbound connectivity to Alpine/Ubuntu package
# mirrors, Docker Hub, and AWS API endpoints to download container images and security updates.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AVD-AWS-0107: Ingress SSH rule on port 22.
# Justification: Parameterized via variable 'allowed_ssh_cidr' for dynamic assignment.
# Production deployments supply a specific administrator IP (/32) in terraform.tfvars.
AVD-AWS-0107
